			</p>
			<p>
				We work closely with our clients (both private and corporate) to develop a cohesive
				concept for the design plan, including aesthetic preferences and overall desired effect.
			</p>
			<p>
				<span>TANGOREN HOLF</span> is a bridge that facilitates navigating the multifarious
				aspects of the art world with confidence and ease at a fair market price. We tap into
				our vast knowledge and passion for art, business acumen and connections, to select
				artwork that creates a collection of interest or enhances existing pieces in order to
				bring our collaborative vision to life.
			</p>
			<p>
				At <span>TANGOREN HOLF</span>, we believe artwork represents elements of a story that
				collectively culminate into an inspiring narrative. As such, it's our goal to find the
				perfect pieces that suit <em>your</em> taste and tell <em>your</em> individual story.
			</p>
